{"sectionId":"acid/buffer-titration","items":[{"id":"acid--buffer-titration-k001","sectionId":"acid/buffer-titration","unitId":"acid","subject":"chemistry","text":"약산/짝염기 완충계는 pH=pKa+log([A⁻]/[HA])의 Henderson–Hasselbalch 식으로 근사한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"acid--buffer-titration-k002","sectionId":"acid/buffer-titration","unitId":"acid","subject":"chemistry","text":"첨가한 강산 또는 강염기는 먼저 화학량론적으로 반응시킨 뒤 남은 완충종으로 평형을 계산한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"acid--buffer-titration-k003","sectionId":"acid/buffer-titration","unitId":"acid","subject":"chemistry","text":"완충능은 pH≈pKa이고 전체 완충종 농도가 높을 때 크다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"acid--buffer-titration-k004","sectionId":"acid/buffer-titration","unitId":"acid","subject":"chemistry","text":"희석은 비율을 크게 바꾸지 않아도 완충능을 낮춘다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"acid--buffer-titration-k005","sectionId":"acid/buffer-titration","unitId":"acid","subject":"chemistry","text":"짝산-약염기계에도 같은 원리를 적용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"acid--buffer-titration-k006","sectionId":"acid/buffer-titration","unitId":"acid","subject":"chemistry","text":"강산-강염기 적정의 당량점 pH는 25℃ 이상적 조건에서 7이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"acid--buffer-titration-k007","sectionId":"acid/buffer-titration","unitId":"acid","subject":"chemistry","text":"약산-강염기는 당량점에 짝염기 가수분해로 pH>7, 약염기-강산은 pH<7이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"acid--buffer-titration-k008","sectionId":"acid/buffer-titration","unitId":"acid","subject":"chemistry","text":"약산 적정 반당량점은 pH=pKa이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"acid--buffer-titration-k009","sectionId":"acid/buffer-titration","unitId":"acid","subject":"chemistry","text":"당량점은 화학량론적 반응 완료점이고 종말점은 지시약·기기 신호에 의해 관찰되는 점이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"acid--buffer-titration-k010","sectionId":"acid/buffer-titration","unitId":"acid","subject":"chemistry","text":"지시약의 변색 범위가 급격한 pH 변화 구간과 겹치도록 선택한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"acid--buffer-titration-k011","sectionId":"acid/buffer-titration","unitId":"acid","subject":"chemistry","text":"다양성자산 적정에서 단계별 분리가 충분하지 않으면 모든 당량점이 명확하지 않다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"acid--buffer-titration-k012","sectionId":"acid/buffer-titration","unitId":"acid","subject":"chemistry","text":"강산·강염기 첨가 후 먼저 몰수 반응 계산.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"acid--buffer-titration-k013","sectionId":"acid/buffer-titration","unitId":"acid","subject":"chemistry","text":"반당량점 pH=pKa(단양성자 약산 적정).","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"acid--buffer-titration-k014","sectionId":"acid/buffer-titration","unitId":"acid","subject":"chemistry","text":"완충 용액은 pH 변화에 저항하지만 무한 용량이 아니다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"acid--buffer-titration-k015","sectionId":"acid/buffer-titration","unitId":"acid","subject":"chemistry","text":"당량점과 종말점을 구별한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"acid--buffer-titration-k016","sectionId":"acid/buffer-titration","unitId":"acid","subject":"chemistry","text":"약 5.8이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]}]}